# Phase 6: large Mip-NeRF 360 garden splat scenes (hundreds of MB)
# — synthetic_smoke.ply IS committed (~7 KB, deterministic, regenerable
#   from scripts/gen_synthetic_smoke_ply.py).
# — garden_50k.ply / garden_500k.ply are NOT (download per
#   aether_cpp/test_data/splat/README.md).
aether_cpp/test_data/splat/garden_*.ply
aether_cpp/test_data/splat/garden_*.spz
aether_cpp/test_data/splat/garden_*.splat

